{"id":"n79404-1-9","stage":0,"title":"중 · 当中","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79404-1-9-1","ko":"너희 형제들 중 누가 제일 키가 크니?","zh":"你们兄弟当中谁个子最高啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형제들","meaning":"兄弟","explanation":"형제：兄弟；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"2","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크니?","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚